WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.851
Smith!" Roxy scratched her head.

2
00:00:14.871 --> 00:00:16.912
"Where did he go?"

3
00:00:18.053 --> 00:00:19.653
One of the guards pointed toward the bus.

4
00:00:21.174 --> 00:00:22.055
Roxy flew over.

5
00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:25.277
She found the detective hiding behind the bus.

6
00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:27.258
Roxy frowned.

7
00:00:28.118 --> 00:00:29.259
"What are you doing?

8
00:00:29.739 --> 00:00:30.820
We have to catch Mr.

9
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.613
Bubbles!" Detective Smith bit his lip.

10
00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.754
"Don't tell anyone.

11
00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:38.556
But I'm afraid of clowns."

12
00:00:39.457 --> 00:00:40.518
Roxy was shocked.

13
00:00:40.538 --> 00:00:42.799
"Really?" "Yes!"

14
00:00:43.199 --> 00:00:44.180
Detective Smith said.

15
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.642
"So can you catch Mr.

16
00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:47.602
Bubbles on your own?"

17
00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:50.304
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

18
00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:53.586
"I won't tell anyone you're afraid of clowns, Detective.

19
00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.388
But you should really face your fear."

20
00:00:57.589 --> 00:00:58.770
Detective Smith sighed.

21
00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.111
"You're right.

22
00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:01.772
You go ahead.

23
00:01:02.288 --> 00:01:04.709
I'll follow in my patrol car and meet you downtown."

24
00:01:04.729 --> 00:01:07.970
"Okay, Detective," Roxy said.

25
00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:09.710
"But you'd better be there!"

26
00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:11.891
Roxy flew off.

27
00:01:14.872 --> 00:01:18.693
She soon spotted a tiny clown car speeding through downtown Metro City.

28
00:01:19.753 --> 00:01:21.173
Two police cars chased it.

29
00:01:22.954 --> 00:01:24.954
A clown leaned out of the tiny car's window.

30
00:01:25.755 --> 00:01:26.975
His hair was bright green.

31
00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:30.456
"I'm never going back to that filthy prison!

32
00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:32.077
Do you hear me?

33
00:01:33.018 --> 00:01:36.580
Never!" Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

34
00:01:37.121 --> 00:01:41.304
Whiz-hoo! One of the tiny car's tires popped.

35
00:01:42.565 --> 00:01:43.846
The car skidded to a stop.

36
00:01:45.748 --> 00:01:47.369
The clown with green hair stepped out.

37
00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.892
A flower was pinned to his jacket.

38
00:01:52.413 --> 00:01:53.734
Another clown got out of the car.

39
00:01:54.474 --> 00:01:56.216
Then two more clowns got out too.

40
00:01:58.432 --> 00:02:00.934
"How did they all fit in that tiny car?"

41
00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:01.794
Roxy thought.

42
00:02:02.635 --> 00:02:04.636
The clown with green hair glared at Roxy.

43
00:02:05.177 --> 00:02:06.217
"Rocket Girl!"

44
00:02:06.237 --> 00:02:08.959
"I'm taking you back to prison, Mr.

45
00:02:09.099 --> 00:02:10.580
Bubbles!" Roxy shouted.

46
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.682
"And everyone in your gang will be joining you!"

47
00:02:14.703 --> 00:02:15.824
Mr. Bubbles chuckled.

48
00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:19.006
"What do you think, boys?

49
00:02:19.526 --> 00:02:22.008
Should we let this little girl take us to prison?"

50
00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:25.290
The other clowns laughed.

51
00:02:26.311 --> 00:02:27.532
"No way, boss!"

52
00:02:28.216 --> 00:02:29.697
"Prison sounds terrible!"

53
00:02:30.678 --> 00:02:32.119
Mr. Bubbles stared at Roxy.

54
00:02:32.139 --> 00:02:33.700
"You heard the clowns.

55
00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.101
We're not going!"

56
00:02:36.442 --> 00:02:38.724
He pulled a bottle from his pocket and pressed a button.

57
00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:40.725
Liquid sprayed out.

58
00:02:42.006 --> 00:02:44.347
Roxy jumped up, and the liquid hit a mailbox.

59
00:02:45.188 --> 00:02:46.789
The mailbox melted into a puddle.

60
00:02:46.809 --> 00:02:49.651
"Yikes!" Roxy gulped.

61
00:02:49.671 --> 00:02:52.153
"This clown really is evil!"

62
00:02:52.173 --> 00:02:53.554
"Ha-ha-ha!" Mr.

63
00:02:53.594 --> 00:02:56.096
Bubbles let out an evil laugh and pressed the button again.

64
00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.140
But no more liquid came out.

65
00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.941
"Ugh! It's empty!"

66
00:03:04.022 --> 00:03:05.802
Mr. Bubbles threw the bottle at the ground.

67
00:03:05.822 --> 00:03:07.863
"Don't worry, boss!"

68
00:03:08.463 --> 00:03:10.303
Another clown ran back to the tiny car.

69
00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.724
"This will take care of Rocket Girl!"

70
00:03:15.085 --> 00:03:16.145
He popped open the trunk.

71
00:03:17.365 --> 00:03:19.546
Roxy heard a rumble and some loud squeaks.

72
00:03:21.707 --> 00:03:22.567
Roxy gasped.

73
00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:26.368
Big balloon animals leaped from the trunk!
